{"v":4,"desc":"終極 Handpan 模擬器現已在 Nintendo Switch™ 上推出\n\n與在 Nintendo Switch™ 上演奏的大多數其他樂器不同，Handpan 非常容易學習、創作和為您的朋友和家人演奏美妙的音樂。\n\n使用觸控螢幕或 Joy-Con 彈奏 Handpan，也稱為掛鼓，可輕鬆更改 Handpan 的音調或音階，並製作您自己的音樂作品。\n\n您還可以選擇 Solo 或 Duo 模式（兩個Joy-Con）","publisher":"Sabec","release":"2021-11-04","genres":["音樂","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d82306b551a1cc44a629ca4175b2ee1a2f5e3f4d59404abd3d15a82849e92450.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/79b01041bc27e106eabf1d70db83ad5e9e3167a3e4d7936345b8270009d2288e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9938e77f5c26362a3da830178f8ffe7d18c8240be20972438af24a5ea0c92cb1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6325a45d99c1a1ba12d6d57d8edf27018d26c68bb4455c2adbb15f418f30d981.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/abf1e705e9f87ee82014a2daad0158cffa0d28d240580ffed48872fa1d1b92d9.jpg"],"titleId":"010086d01674e000","dlc":[]}